{"parse":{"title":"个性/魔力充沛","pageid":5458,"revid":12754,"text":"<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><p><br />\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<div id=\"bread-edit\" class=\"bread-edit\" style=\"float:right;margin-top:10px;margin-right:10px\"><sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7/%E9%AD%94%E5%8A%9B%E5%85%85%E6%B2%9B&amp;action=edit\">编</a></sup> <sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7/%E9%AD%94%E5%8A%9B%E5%85%85%E6%B2%9B&amp;action=purge\">刷</a></sup> <sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7/%E9%AD%94%E5%8A%9B%E5%85%85%E6%B2%9B&amp;action=history\">历</a></sup></div>\n<div style=\"padding: 5px 10px;margin: 10px 0;border: 1px solid #ebccd1;border-left-width: 5px;border-radius: 3px;background: rgb(255 255 255 / 40%);\">\n<a href=\"/llzj/%E9%A6%96%E9%A1%B5\" title=\"首页\">首页</a> &gt; <a href=\"/llzj/%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93\" title=\"技能图鉴库\">技能图鉴库</a> &gt; <b>魔力充沛</b><br /></div>\n<hr />\n<h2><span id=\".E9.AD.94.E5.8A.9B.E5.85.85.E6.B2.9B\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"魔力充沛\"><b>魔力充沛</b></span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%A8%A1%E6%9D%BF:%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=T-1\" title=\"编辑章节：\">编辑</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%;text-align:center\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<th colspan=\"3\">个性详情\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"text-nowrap\" style=\"width:20%;\" rowspan=\"5\"><img alt=\"个性 魔力充沛.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/2/2b/a5wjpka3p8oyqvwa7aeb8fxed24b20x.png/80px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7_%E9%AD%94%E5%8A%9B%E5%85%85%E6%B2%9B.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/2/2b/a5wjpka3p8oyqvwa7aeb8fxed24b20x.png/120px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7_%E9%AD%94%E5%8A%9B%E5%85%85%E6%B2%9B.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/2/2b/a5wjpka3p8oyqvwa7aeb8fxed24b20x.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"128\" data-file-height=\"128\" /><br />魔力充沛\n</th>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\" style=\"width:60%;\">&#160;<img alt=\"个性一星.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/f/ff/it8jh8njwjg4jrxn4b2f0iwnlxlm1a7.png/56px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%B8%80%E6%98%9F.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"56\" height=\"14\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/f/ff/it8jh8njwjg4jrxn4b2f0iwnlxlm1a7.png/84px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%B8%80%E6%98%9F.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/f/ff/it8jh8njwjg4jrxn4b2f0iwnlxlm1a7.png/112px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%B8%80%E6%98%9F.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"224\" data-file-height=\"56\" /><br />&#160;\n<p>魔攻，生命值提高<font color=\"#ed7950\">3%</font>。战斗开始时，获得<font color=\"#ed7950\">1</font>层[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"魔力充沛\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">魔力充沛</font></span></span>]；释放[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\">职业技能</span>]后，消耗<font color=\"#ed7950\">1</font>层。\n</p>\n</td>\n<td class=\"text-nowrap\" style=\"width:20%;\" rowspan=\"5\"><b>该个性属于</b><br /><br /><div class=\"hero_head\" style=\"width:90px;height:90px;\">\n<div class=\"hero_head_img\"><a href=\"/llzj/%E8%A7%92%E8%89%B2%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E7%8E%9B%E9%9C%B2%E8%A5%BF%E5%B0%94\" title=\"角色图鉴库/玛露西尔\"><img alt=\"头像 玛露西尔.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/1/11/6y6wet22qlt8qr0hdg807eltm35jjql.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"90\" height=\"90\" class=\"img-kk\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"64\" /></a></div>\n<div class=\"hero_head_name\" style=\"width:90px;\"><font color=\"#fff\">玛露西尔</font></div>\n</div>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\">&#160;<img alt=\"个性二星.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/e/e0/s8dzgwxdvuvhjug8aqjcnr6vmgsi5ao.png/56px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%BA%8C%E6%98%9F.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"56\" height=\"14\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/e/e0/s8dzgwxdvuvhjug8aqjcnr6vmgsi5ao.png/84px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%BA%8C%E6%98%9F.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/e/e0/s8dzgwxdvuvhjug8aqjcnr6vmgsi5ao.png/112px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%BA%8C%E6%98%9F.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"224\" data-file-height=\"56\" /><br />&#160;\n<p>魔攻，生命值提高<font color=\"#ed7950\">6%</font>。战斗开始时，获得<font color=\"#ed7950\">1</font>层[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"魔力充沛\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">魔力充沛</font></span></span>]；释放[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\">职业技能</span>]后，消耗<font color=\"#ed7950\">1</font>层；每有1点能量，治疗效果和伤害提高<font color=\"#ed7950\">3%</font>。\n</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\">&#160;<img alt=\"个性三星.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/0/07/czx3heixk04558ia8wj7hpokhzl5cbx.png/56px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%B8%89%E6%98%9F.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"56\" height=\"14\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/0/07/czx3heixk04558ia8wj7hpokhzl5cbx.png/84px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%B8%89%E6%98%9F.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/0/07/czx3heixk04558ia8wj7hpokhzl5cbx.png/112px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%B8%89%E6%98%9F.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"224\" data-file-height=\"56\" /><br />&#160;\n<p>魔攻，生命值提高<font color=\"#ed7950\">9%</font>。战斗开始时，获得<font color=\"#ed7950\">2</font>层[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"魔力充沛\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">魔力充沛</font></span></span>]；释放[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\">职业技能</span>]后，消耗<font color=\"#ed7950\">1</font>层；执行[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"待机\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">待机</font></span></span>]时，可获得<font color=\"#ed7950\">1</font>层，每有1点能量，治疗效果和伤害提高<font color=\"#ed7950\">4%</font>。\n</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\">&#160;<img alt=\"个性四星.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/1/10/eer5d47lht2ycljkd8fe3yu05q10ccr.png/56px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E5%9B%9B%E6%98%9F.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"56\" height=\"14\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/1/10/eer5d47lht2ycljkd8fe3yu05q10ccr.png/84px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E5%9B%9B%E6%98%9F.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/1/10/eer5d47lht2ycljkd8fe3yu05q10ccr.png/112px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E5%9B%9B%E6%98%9F.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"224\" data-file-height=\"56\" /><br />&#160;\n<p>魔攻，生命值提高<font color=\"#ed7950\">12%</font>。战斗开始时，获得<font color=\"#ed7950\">2</font>层[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"魔力充沛\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">魔力充沛</font></span></span>]；释放[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\">职业技能</span>]后，消耗<font color=\"#ed7950\">1</font>层；执行[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"待机\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">待机</font></span></span>]时，可获得<font color=\"#ed7950\">1</font>层，每有1点能量，治疗效果和伤害提高<font color=\"#ed7950\">5%</font>。\n</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\">&#160;<img alt=\"个性五星.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/2/20/l6fgusj2lxp7caktkwbmf1ioo2m7utz.png/56px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%BA%94%E6%98%9F.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"56\" height=\"14\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/2/20/l6fgusj2lxp7caktkwbmf1ioo2m7utz.png/84px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%BA%94%E6%98%9F.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/2/20/l6fgusj2lxp7caktkwbmf1ioo2m7utz.png/112px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%BA%94%E6%98%9F.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"224\" data-file-height=\"56\" /><br />&#160;\n<p>魔攻，生命值提高<font color=\"#ed7950\">15%</font>。战斗开始时，获得<font color=\"#ed7950\">2</font>层[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"魔力充沛\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">魔力充沛</font></span></span>]；释放[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\">职业技能</span>]后，消耗<font color=\"#ed7950\">1</font>层；执行[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"待机\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">待机</font></span></span>]时，可获得<font color=\"#ed7950\">2</font>层，每有1点能量，治疗效果和伤害提高<font color=\"#ed7950\">8%</font>。\n</p>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261022163444\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\n[SMW] In‐text annotation parser time: 0 seconds\nCPU time usage: 0.176 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.268 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 3510/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 34058/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 9555/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 13/40\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%  239.023      1 模板:个性\n100.00%  239.023      1 -total\n 35.58%   85.036      5 模板:中括号介绍化\n 32.62%   77.962     13 模板:中括号介绍\n  3.65%    8.725      1 模板:面包屑\n  2.02%    4.837      1 模板:列表/头像\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key gamecenter_wiki_llzj-pre_:pcache:idhash:5458-0!dateformat=default and timestamp 20261022163444 and revision id 12754. Serialized with PHP.\n -->\n</div>","categories":[{"sortkey":"","category":"个性","missing":true}],"images":["个性_魔力充沛.png","个性一星.png","头像_玛露西尔.png","个